**1. Who we are**

AI Health Scan is a wellness and educational photo-analysis app. It reviews photos you capture (front face and side profile) and related information you enter (such as age and gender) to generate AI-based wellness insights.

The App is **not a medical device**, is **not a diagnostic service**, and does **not** provide medical advice, treatment, or emergency care. Results may be inaccurate or incomplete. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical concerns.

Developer / operator: Aladdin Apps  
Support: junaid@pkteam.com

