**11. Delete your account and associated data**

You may delete your account at any time. Deletion is permanent.

**In the App**  
1. Open AI Health Scan and sign in.  
2. Go to **Profile**.  
3. Open **Danger Zone**.  
4. Tap **Delete Account**.  
5. Enter your password and tap **Delete permanently**.

This deletes your account and associated data, including profile information and server account data, and removes scans saved on that device.

**If you cannot use the App**  
Email **junaid@pkteam.com** from the same email address as your account, with the subject: **Delete my AI Health Scan account**.

We complete deletion as soon as reasonably possible, typically within **30 days**. Limited records may be kept if required by law. Uninstalling the App alone does not delete your online account.

